WEBVTT

00:35:29.746 --> 00:35:33.913
I mean, I can't say enough what
a powerfully humbling

00:35:33.913 --> 00:35:35.246
and healing act that was.

00:35:36.204 --> 00:35:42.829
And it seems unimaginable to me to
consider hiking 11 hundred miles in near

00:35:42.829 --> 00:35:46.079
solitude without a phone on the Internet.

00:35:46.121 --> 00:35:49.663
Well, the phone off the entire time, I
mean, it's just not even comprehensible.

00:35:49.663 --> 00:35:50.704
What would people say?

00:35:51.496 --> 00:35:55.496
Well, that's really this was 1995.

00:35:55.496 --> 00:35:57.663
And I didn't realize until, you know,

00:35:57.663 --> 00:36:01.038
I was sort of midway through
wild that I realized, oh,